{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sPryaLacgm1795141822.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價終止連續兩天的跌勢。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.712，較上個交易日上調11點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.67水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展4,995億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放1,200億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:28:59.645155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T02:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:23.800544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:25.597595+00:00","content_hash":"b6cc7968fcb6f4a7658dae16ceb318c63d9e9f13fcb9e7724208ba64c401083d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:28:59.645155+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}